      "Text": "不知道老師"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100950220,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "願不願意……\n和我一起去看這場展覽……？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100950230,
      "Speaker": "Player",
      "Text": "沒問題，我剛好有兩張票哦"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100950240,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "真的嗎！？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100950250,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "非常感謝！"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100950260,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "StoryEpisode": 2,
      "Text": "也就是說……我可以小小期待一下吧？"
    },
    {
      "Id": 100950270,
      "Speaker": "Student",
      "Text": "主人，您在嗎？"
